(1 Purpose) Tj T*
(This procedure defines how recall procedure is carried out at Lakemoor.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(2 Scope) Tj T*
(Applies to all recall procedure activities in production and quality control at Lakemoor \(revised in revision 03\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(3 Responsibilities) Tj T*
(The process owner, Jonas Dorsey, maintains this procedure. Quality approves it \(revised in revision 02\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 Procedure) Tj T*
(Step 1: Confirm the logbook entry.) Tj T*
(Step 2: Clean the equipment status label.) Tj T*
(Step 3: Document deviations to Quality within one day.) Tj T*
(Step 4: Escalate the area is free of previous materials.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 Records) Tj T*
(Records of recall procedure are kept for five years after batch expiry \(revised in revision 03\).) Tj T*
